{"series":{"id":"great-doctor-miss-nine","slug":"great-doctor-miss-nine","title":"Great Doctor Miss Nine","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/great-doctor-miss-nine-2__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"La doctora e investigadora Jun Jiu es víctima de una bebida adulterada en una trama comercial. Después de haber sido arrastrada a un agujero de gusano por una chica desconocida, Jun Jiu inadvertidamente intercambia almas con ella y es transmigrada a un mundo de cultivo desconocido como hija de la familia Jun. Después de decidir vengarse de aquellos que habían hecho daño al dueño anterior de su cuerpo, Jun Jiu salva a un Mo Wuyue sellado sin darse cuenta de su verdadera identidad. Con firme determinación y conocimiento de su vida anterior, Jun Jiu camina por el camino del cultivo junto con su gato místico, mientras que Mo Wuyue la apoya desde las sombras a pesar de su fachada distante.","genres":["Acción","Cultivo","Reencarnación","Venganza"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/great-doctor-miss-nine","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:30:59.496Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"great-doctor-miss-nine-1","slug":"great-doctor-miss-nine-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/great-doctor-miss-nine-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"great-doctor-miss-nine","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/great-doctor-miss-nine-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:31:58.970Z","episodeCount":60,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":60,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true},{"id":"great-doctor-miss-nine-2","slug":"great-doctor-miss-nine-2","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/great-doctor-miss-nine-2-1","image":null,"number":2,"seriesId":"great-doctor-miss-nine","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/great-doctor-miss-nine-2-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:31:25.637Z","episodeCount":20,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":20,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"great-d